{"time": "2026-02-22T00:21:02", "query": "workflow verify", "top_k": 3, "hits": [{"chunk_id": "CHK-0001", "doc_id": "DOC-fa16fb47", "score": 2, "cite": "derivations/README.md#L1", "source_sha256": "sha256:bb1d58396c3a4953869ccdfa9b93a1d85308eb3277f0799362a562d5cccea6d0", "snippet": "# Derivations Workflow / 推导资产化规范\n\n## 规则\n- 每个 lemma/theorem 必须有 markdown 推导文件。\n- 每个关键推导至少有一个可运行验证脚本。\n- 推荐同时有 pytest 用例，便于统一 `workflow verify`。\n\n## 目录建议\n- `derivations/examples/*.md`：推导说明\n- `derivations/examples/*_check.py`：验证脚本（SymPy/数值对拍）\n\n", "heading": "Derivations Workflow / 推导资产化规范"}, {"chunk_id": "CHK-0002", "doc_id": "DOC-d5a222b2", "score": 2, "cite": "projects/rl-gridworld-qlearning/derivations/q_learning_bellman_check.py#L31", "source_sha256": "sha256:14dc283faa14b0c43651ec8ae0ebf787a115174ff6ade1c5410682c0924825cc", "snippet": "    assert lhs <= rhs, f\"Contraction violated: lhs={lhs}, rhs={rhs}\"\n\n\ndef sampled_update_matches_target() -> None:\n    gamma = 0.95\n    q = np.array(\n        [\n            [0.5, -0.2, 0.1],\n            [1.2, 0.0, 0.8],\n            [0.3, 0.", "heading": ""}, {"chunk_id": "CHK-0003", "doc_id": "DOC-b76f66e4", "score": 2, "cite": "docs/WORKFLOW.md#L51", "source_sha256": "sha256:5b488a9c06eb2f5dea44aa0c9fbf89ddee5cc5ed35decf128535e530a2715bf8", "snippet": "- `release publish` 仅导出项目目录 `projects/<slug>/`，不会发布整个源仓库。\n- 发布 PR 会记录到 `state/PR_REGISTRY.yaml`，并标记 `role: release`。\n\n## 5. 验证与审计\n```bash\npython3 -m workflow verify\npython3 -m workflow audit\n```\n输出位置：\n- 验证报告：`artifacts/test/`\n- 审计报告：`artifa", "heading": "WORKFLOW 使用说明 / Daily Playbook"}]}